# Styling

- Use **Tailwind utility classes** on markup for all layout, spacing, color, and typography.
- Theme tokens live in `tailwind.config.ts` and `@theme` in `src/styles/global.css`.
- Do **not** add `<style>` blocks, CSS modules, or one-off `.css` files for components.
- Custom CSS is allowed only for unavoidable cases (third-party embeds, browser bugs). Document each case in `docs/design-learning.md`.
- Prefer semantic token classes (`bg-surface`, `text-brand`) over raw palette jumps when a token exists.
